.TH Command "TRADE REPORT"
.SY "trade"
The trade report lists
all ships that are being sold and allows you to buy them.
.s3
Typical output looks like:
.EX trade
.NF

	Empire Naval Trade Report
    Sun Feb  5 19:27:06 1984
100% oil derrick civ:0 mil:0 guns:0 shells:0 @$472.50  lot #0
100% aircraft carrier civ:0 mil:0 guns:0 shells:0 @$535.50  lot #1
100% battleship civ:1 mil:0 guns:0 shells:0 @$582.75  lot #2
100% yacht civ:1 mil:2 guns:0 shells:0 @$535.50  your own lot
Which lot? (<CR> for none) 0
You are now $473.00 poorer.
You have just bought ship #8
Which lot? (<CR> for none) 
.FI
.s3
Note that the yacht was merely identified as "your own lot" since you
can't buy from yourself.
Also note that the purchase should have cost $472.50, but the total
amount is always rounded up.
.s3
